# 基本図形編集のキャンバスと画材を、デスクトップの図形編集とプロセスの図形編集で同じに使う
# (design 11.3, 17.13), for tools/ui_run.py. A figure of one rectangle and two zigzag lines
# (mkbig fig 1 2 0) opened at 100,100; its 道具パネル at the top of the screen (100,0), the
# first row's middles at y 48, 34 apart from x 128 (キャンバス 264,48; 選択 298,48). With the
# canvas a box is dragged out from 300,250 to 420,330 and painted in at once: a stroke of the
# pencil. The canvas button, while it paints, brings up the 画材 palette under it: 絵筆
# (460,95), 10px (575,211) and red (460,181) chosen, Escape. A stroke of the brush, then
# 絵の具 (520,120) poured at 410,320. Escape ends the painting and writes the picture.
# Pressed twice with the pointer in hand, the picture is painted on again: 消しゴム (580,95)
# drawn across it; a press outside ends it. Saved: record 0 (its UUIDs as noughts, the
# picture's name holding the object's) and the picture beside it come out the same, byte for
# byte, and the screens at each step are kept to be compared. The strokes run straight across:
# the desktop takes the moves of a drag as they come, several at once when it is busy (as a
# hand's are), and a stroke joins the places it was given, so a slanting one would come out a
# pixel apart from run to run on the desktop itself.
# Keys: Esc 29; Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
# the desktop's figure editor opened by open, whatever the program object says (figproc kernel)
figproc kernel
mkbig fig 1 2 0
open big
waitwin 画用紙 600
sync 600
wait 500
click 264 48
wait 300
drag 300 250 420 330
wait 500
drag 320 270 400 270
wait 400
shot cvc_k_paint
click 264 48
wait 600
shot cvc_k_pal
click 460 95
wait 300
click 575 211
wait 300
click 460 181
wait 300
key 29
wait 400
drag 310 300 410 300
wait 400
click 264 48
wait 600
click 520 120
wait 300
key 29
wait 400
click 410 320
wait 400
shot cvc_k_pour
key 29
wait 400
shot cvc_k_left
click 298 48
wait 300
dclick 330 320
wait 600
click 264 48
wait 600
click 580 95
wait 300
key 29
wait 400
drag 305 290 415 290
wait 400
shot cvc_k_erase
click 700 500
wait 400
shot cvc_k_done
sync 600
key 16 01
sync 600
sum anon
keep kernel
sum res _0_1.png
keep kernelpic
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig fig 1 2 0
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 3
wait 800
logmark
click 264 48
expectsince figure: tool 1
drag 300 250 420 330
expectsince figure: drawn
wait 300
logmark
drag 320 270 400 270
expectsince figure: painted
wait 300
shot cvc_p_paint
logmark
click 264 48
expectsince figure: palette 4 open
wait 600
shot cvc_p_pal
click 460 95
wait 300
click 575 211
wait 300
click 460 181
wait 300
logmark
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 4 closed
wait 300
logmark
drag 310 300 410 300
expectsince figure: painted
logmark
click 264 48
expectsince figure: palette 4 open
wait 600
click 520 120
wait 300
logmark
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 4 closed
logmark
click 410 320
expectsince figure: painted
wait 300
shot cvc_p_pour
logmark
key 29
expectsince figure: picture written
expectsince figure: canvas left
wait 300
shot cvc_p_left
logmark
click 298 48
expectsince figure: tool 0
logmark
dclick 330 320
expectsince figure: canvas taken
wait 300
logmark
click 264 48
expectsince figure: palette 4 open
wait 600
click 580 95
wait 300
logmark
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 4 closed
logmark
drag 305 290 415 290
expectsince figure: painted
wait 300
shot cvc_p_erase
logmark
click 700 500
expectsince figure: picture written
wait 300
shot cvc_p_done
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince figure: saved (0)
sum anon
same kernel
sum res _0_1.png
same kernelpic
key 08 01
expect figure: closed
